{"5069810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ministrelli's Cardboard Circus", "steam_appid": 5069810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new lightboy for the Ministrelli Circus, and it's your job to let the artists shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your spotlights, work the soundboard, and blast smoke and confetti, all at exactly the right moment. Keep the performers lit and the crowd roaring. Lose track of the act and your score drops; lose the audience entirely and you're running the show again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the Rig<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/75edcbec6014c139259af41730070e61.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/75edcbec6014c139259af41730070e61.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a single spotlight. Progress through the show and you'll unlock extra spots to track multiple performers at once, soundboards, confetti cannons and more, until you're juggling a full rig where everything has to fire in sync.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Circus Full of Characters<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/3e82e56a656c5ca126dc713f0d05a54f.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/3e82e56a656c5ca126dc713f0d05a54f.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into short chapters, each built around a different circus member as the main act, with multiple acts to complete. Between them you head backstage: the cast share stories, gossip and grudges, and how you handle them can shape both the gameplay and who takes the spotlight next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live effects control</strong>: track performers with your spotlights and fire sound, smoke and confetti on cue<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/fa6bf8d04ae5be7c30dc6e845a12463a.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/fa6bf8d04ae5be7c30dc6e845a12463a.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable rig</strong>:  grow from one struggling spotlight to a full multi-effect setup<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/0c20e757a947d340fb8f328885a40f3f.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/0c20e757a947d340fb8f328885a40f3f.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-based acts</strong>: every circus member gets their turn as the star<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/ae2f49fa1eea9b311ccfab7f940b539e.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/ae2f49fa1eea9b311ccfab7f940b539e.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=412 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backstage relationships</strong>: talk with the cast between acts, learn their stories, and influence who becomes the next star through your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative boss battles</strong>: face the circus's biggest, most demanding performances<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/c4e95c0aaec76853b4b028bc53fc527b.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/c4e95c0aaec76853b4b028bc53fc527b.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story under the big top</strong>: uncover the cast's history, rivalries and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the spotlight, watch for director Ministrelli's countdowns, and prove you've got what it takes to run the greatest show under the big top.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new lightboy for the Ministrelli Circus, and it's your job to let the artists shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your spotlights, work the soundboard, and blast smoke and confetti, all at exactly the right moment. Keep the performers lit and the crowd roaring. Lose track of the act and your score drops; lose the audience entirely and you're running the show again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the Rig<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/75edcbec6014c139259af41730070e61.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/75edcbec6014c139259af41730070e61.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a single spotlight. Progress through the show and you'll unlock extra spots to track multiple performers at once, soundboards, confetti cannons and more, until you're juggling a full rig where everything has to fire in sync.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Circus Full of Characters<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/3e82e56a656c5ca126dc713f0d05a54f.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/3e82e56a656c5ca126dc713f0d05a54f.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into short chapters, each built around a different circus member as the main act, with multiple acts to complete. Between them you head backstage: the cast share stories, gossip and grudges, and how you handle them can shape both the gameplay and who takes the spotlight next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live effects control</strong>: track performers with your spotlights and fire sound, smoke and confetti on cue<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/fa6bf8d04ae5be7c30dc6e845a12463a.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/fa6bf8d04ae5be7c30dc6e845a12463a.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable rig</strong>:  grow from one struggling spotlight to a full multi-effect setup<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/0c20e757a947d340fb8f328885a40f3f.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/0c20e757a947d340fb8f328885a40f3f.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-based acts</strong>: every circus member gets their turn as the star<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/ae2f49fa1eea9b311ccfab7f940b539e.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/ae2f49fa1eea9b311ccfab7f940b539e.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=412 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backstage relationships</strong>: talk with the cast between acts, learn their stories, and influence who becomes the next star through your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative boss battles</strong>: face the circus's biggest, most demanding performances<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras/c4e95c0aaec76853b4b028bc53fc527b.avif?t=1787988316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/extras_big/c4e95c0aaec76853b4b028bc53fc527b.avif?t=1787988316 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story under the big top</strong>: uncover the cast's history, rivalries and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the spotlight, watch for director Ministrelli's countdowns, and prove you've got what it takes to run the greatest show under the big top.</p>", "short_description": "You are the new light board operator and it's your job to let the artists shine.  Aim lights, control soundboards, blast smoke and shoot confetti! All at the right timings. Can you juggle all the tasks? Keep an eye out for director Ministrelli's countdowns and you'll be sure to have great success.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/3f9910d175b6271ccee97584e22a002eebe5fdf5/header.jpg?t=1787988316", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069810/f27755b7acd3a1414db5717e95d6ee81102b0c89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787988316", "capsule_imagev5": "https://sha